{"type":"standard","title":"Lisa Demuth","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lisa Demuth</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q58416642","titles":{"canonical":"Lisa_Demuth","normalized":"Lisa Demuth","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lisa Demuth</span></span>"},"pageid":59005146,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Lisa_Demuth%2C_2026_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Lisa_Demuth%2C_2026_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/Lisa_Demuth%2C_2026_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1625,"height":2167},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375493226","tid":"e1d561f6-b30d-11f1-8034-bdc1d5bfdc14","timestamp":"2026-09-18T03:06:03Z","description":"American politician (born 1967)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisa_Demuth","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisa_Demuth?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisa_Demuth?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lisa_Demuth"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisa_Demuth","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lisa_Demuth","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lisa_Demuth?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lisa_Demuth"}},"extract":"Lisa Demuth is an American politician serving since 2025 as the speaker of the Minnesota House of Representatives. A member of the Republican Party of Minnesota, Demuth represents District 13A in central Minnesota, which includes the cities of St. Joseph and Cold Spring and parts of Stearns County. She has served since 2023 as leader of the House Republican caucus and from 2023 to 2025 as the minority leader of the Minnesota House of Representatives.","extract_html":"<p><b>Lisa Demuth</b> is an American politician serving since 2025 as the speaker of the Minnesota House of Representatives. A member of the Republican Party of Minnesota, Demuth represents District 13A in central Minnesota, which includes the cities of St. Joseph and Cold Spring and parts of Stearns County. She has served since 2023 as leader of the House Republican caucus and from 2023 to 2025 as the minority leader of the Minnesota House of Representatives.</p>"}